  "display_title": "Touch Your Heart",
  "description": "Oh Jin-Sim was a star actress until a scandal left her career in tatters. But when a renowned screenwriter offers her the lead in their next legal drama, she knows it could be her comeback. The problem is, Jin-Sim is more famous for her looks than her acting. To prove she can take on the role, she starts working as a real-life legal secretary. Too bad her boss, cold-hearted Gwon Jeong-Rok, is a complete jerk! So why is Jin-Sim catching feelings for him? When it comes to love, there are no laws!\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
